 title="Dual Enrollment Credit Evaluation: A Guide for U.S. Colleges",
 desc="Dual enrollment students are 22% of U.S. community college enrollment. How to evaluate college credit earned in high school, consistently and before orientation.",
 sub="More first-year applicants arrive with college credit already on a transcript. Evaluating it well, and early, shapes placement, time to degree and whether the student enrolls.",
